      account: "With the witness made to resolve (this lane), claim_batch evaluates all 59 claims: 55 PASS, 4 FAIL. Seventeen purpose-built diagnostic claims localize the four. a_binary_only_plan and a_zero_mutation_plan are Refused at [deploy-artifact-gate]: no install-directory/install-file leg creates the attempt-unit-drain helper dir, nor the broker front-door release dir, its .env file or its gunbc binary, so the gate halts and legs_of is empty (this is the release-roster gap the roadmap node deploy-release-roster-carries-every-owned-step declares; the all-kept claim passes only because it manually spells all_kept_roster rows). the_serving_boot_path and the_gpu_power_cap have a READY all-kept plan, but their positive presence checks fail (serving-engine-retire-* / serving-engine-reload, and gpu-power-cap-unit / reload / enable are absent) while every negative check that consumes the fold helpers leg_within_grants, leg_argv_words and leg_payload passes -- so the folds are correct and the legs are simply missing from the plan. The witness folds themselves (the BrokerTree arm and the InstallDirectory/Systemctl/DiagnosedSystemctl arms) are not implicated.",
